[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: High-Level Requirements Specification
PREFIX: HLR-

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: HLR-1
TITLE: Positional Keymaps
STATEMENT: >>>
The editor shall support positional keymaps, i.e. keys mapped based solely on their position.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Positional keymaps have their pros and cons.

**Pros**

- Bigrams can be optimized better

**Cons**

- More complex
- Harder to exchange common keybindings between users
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
https://ki-editor.org/docs/core-concepts/#2-positional-keymaps
<<<
